{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Usability.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Usability.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"usability usability","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Usability.md","fileName":"Usability.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Usability","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 13:11\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[UX Evaluation]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["UX Evaluation","User Experience","3duserinterfaces2ande.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Usability.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Usability.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"usability usability","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Usability.md","fileName":"Usability.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Usability","heading":"Usability","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Usability is the set of qualities of a system or artifact that affect a person's use of it. Three central qualities are effectiveness, efficiency, and satisfaction.\n\n- Effectiveness concerns whether users achieve their goals completely and accurately.\n- Efficiency concerns the time, effort, and other resources required.\n- Satisfaction concerns whether the system is comfortable and acceptable to use.\n\nLearnability, retention, error rate, speed, ease of use, and comfort also contribute. Usability is part of [[User Experience]], but it is not the same as usefulness: a system can be easy to use yet provide no function that a person needs.","tags":["baby"],"links":["UX Evaluation","User Experience","3duserinterfaces2ande.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Usability.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Usability.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"usability usability","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Usability.md","fileName":"Usability.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Usability","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[3duserinterfaces2ande.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["UX Evaluation","User Experience","3duserinterfaces2ande.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}